    5: /// accessors ([blockId], [isBlockText], ...) are convenience views over it.
    6: ///
    7: /// Contract:
    8: /// - [blockText] / [blockCode] identify inline content of a single
    9: ///   [TextBlockNode] / [CodeBlockNode].
   10: /// - [blockObject] identifies an atomic block-level object, such as an image,
   11: ///   video, file attachment, or divider.
   12: /// - [tableCellText] identifies a single cell's first text block. Full
   13: ///   cell editing (multi-block cells, range selection inside cells) is out
   14: ///   of scope until stage 4.
